/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/functions.k:23:  // closureValC(params, cellvars, body, captured-cells). No frame anchor: all
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/functions.k-24-  // enclosing-local reads are freevars (symtable-complete) and go through the
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/functions.k-25-  // captured cells; everything else is global/builtin, so the callee frame's
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/functions.k-26-  // parent is the module scope (0) — sound after the defining frame dies.
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/functions.k:27:  syntax Val ::= closureValC(ParamNames, ParamNames, Stmts, Map)
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/functions.k-28-
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/functions.k-29-  // capture: resolve each freevar to the enclosing frame's cellRef, then bind
