/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/operators.k-32-
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/operators.k-33-  // the left operand of `in`/`not in` is an ELEMENT (compares by ==K) — never deref'd
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/operators.k:34:  rule <k> Compare(ref(H:Int), CmpOp(OP:String, R:Expr)) => Compare(V, CmpOp(OP, R)) ... </k>
