/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/controls.k-10-       <env> L:Int </env>
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/controls.k-11-       <scopes> ... L |-> scope(M:Map => M [ X <- V ], _) ... </scopes>
